# Placeholder mesh for parts that need a physical/visual entry but no real geometry.
# Cannot be an empty file as Stonefish will crash if anything touches the empty mesh.
# A 1 cm tetrahedron is valid while being physically negligible.
v 0.005 0.0 0.0
v -0.005 0.005 0.0
v -0.005 -0.005 0.0
v 0.0 0.0 0.005
f 1 3 2
f 1 2 4
f 2 3 4
f 1 4 3
